  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "106",
  "quote": "A landlord shall apply a rent deposit that a tenant provides to the landlord under subsection (1) or (2) in payment of the rent for the last rent period before the tenancy terminates.",
  "reason": "The Act requires a rent deposit to be applied exclusively toward the rent for the last rent period. It cannot be used as a security or damage deposit to cover cleaning costs or unpaid utility bills."
}

